## Using Toolshed Functions

```elixir
import Toolshed
```

```elixir
# Get the current weather from wttr.in
weather()
```

```elixir
# List network interfaces
ifconfig()
```

```elixir
# List USB devices
lsusb()
```

## Reading the Filesystem Directly

```elixir
"/proc/cpuinfo"
|> File.read!() 
|> IO.puts
```

```elixir
File.ls!("/sys/class")
```

```elixir
File.ls!("/dev")
```
